https://helm.mittwald.de
https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com/
https://*.<kloia-zone>/
http://0.0.0.0:2381/
.*ssh:.*

# Addresses that only ever resolve inside a container or on a guest - compose
# healthcheck commands, and the proxy upstreams in playbooks/1panel/templates.
# They are unreachable from a workstation BY DESIGN, so lychee reaching them
# would be the surprising outcome. Same class as the 0.0.0.0 entry above.
#
# NO PORT AND NO ANCHOR, deliberately. These entries are unanchored regexes, and
# lychee also scans THIS FILE when it is staged - a pattern written as
# `http://localhost:.*` is read out of it as the link `http://localhost/`, which
# that pattern then does not match, and the hook fails on its own ignore list.
http://localhost
http://127\.0\.0\.1

# The same class one layer out: the proxy upstreams in playbooks/1panel that
# are a guest on the VLAN rather than this box's loopback. They were missed
# when the block above was written, because vars/main.yaml had not been staged
# since - so the hook failed on entries nobody had touched, from a workstation
# that is off that segment by design.
http://10\.10\.99\.
